cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "rothcruz: Rothermel surface fire and crown fire spread models verified against the BehavePlus engine"
version: 0.2.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23387346
abstract: >-
  Python library for the Rothermel surface fire spread model, Van Wagner's crown fire criteria and the crown fire
  spread models of Rothermel (1991), Cruz et al. (2005) and Scott and Reinhardt (2001). Every calculation runs in a
  published mode that follows the original equations or in an engine-compatible mode that reproduces the BehavePlus
  calculation engine, and each difference is documented. Verified case by case against the engine (firelab/behave,
  commit d4acc8a).
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - fire behaviour
  - Rothermel
  - crown fire
  - BehavePlus
  - verification
